# .ship-config — audited, committed knobs for `gh ship` (agent-tools ci/ship/ship.sh).
#
# This repo is private, and GitHub Actions minutes for private repos are blocked by account
# billing, so the secret-scan workflow cannot run here; ship then detects CI as structurally down
# and runs its local fallback gate. The local "test" for a dotfiles repo is the same check the
# CI workflow runs: gitleaks over the tree, failing on a leak.
SHIP_LOCAL_TEST_CMD=gitleaks dir . --redact --no-banner --exit-code 1
SHIP_TASK_CODE_PREFIX=DOT
